# Which rule files a main session receives for its role, relative to agent-rules/.
# Read by hooks/session-role.sh when a session starts, resumes or compacts.
#
# The role is $AGENT_ROLE if set, else the name given to `claude --agent`,
# else solo. A name that is not listed here also means solo.
#
# Every main session already loads the kernel, craft/, its harness file and
# its model file through CLAUDE.md. This map adds only the role's own file, so
# a solo session never sees the team files and a team member never sees solo.md.
# A new role is one file in team/ and one line here.
#
# role      rule files
solo        solo.md
lead        solo.md team/lead.md
thinker     team/thinker.md
worker      team/worker.md
